<title>HONG KONG: Esprit Asia 1995/96 net rises 14.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Esprit Asia 1995/96 net rises 14.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   20.5    vs 18.8</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    6.6     vs 6.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil     vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    161.8   vs 141.3</p>
<p>    Turnover		     1,785.3 vs 1,473.3</p>
<p>    Company name		 Esprit Asia Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  November 15-21</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   November 29</p>
<p>NOTE - Esprit Asia Holdings ia a fashion retailer.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is 9.8 H.K. cents (including interim dividend of 3.2 cents) vs nine cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
